  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 8505.01 Blue Envelope Design",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 8505.01 Blue Envelope Design.\n\n(a) The blue envelope shall be:\n\n(1) Blue color for easy identification; and\n\n(2) Sized appropriately to hold a driver’s license, vehicle registration, insurance card, and any medical information.\n\n(b) The exterior of the blue envelope shall include instructions for:\n\n(1) The driver; and\n\n(2) The law enforcement officer.\n\n(3) Emergency contact information;\n\n(4) Sensory considerations; and\n\n(5) Verbal and visual communication.\n\nSource. #14643, INTERIM, eff 7-3-26, EXPIRES: 12-30-26",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c8500.html"
